OL,3,GNEWSAEarl Spencer to 'tell the truth'
OL,4,Aabout his sister Princess Diana in new
OL,5,Abook
OL,6,
OL,7,FEarl Spencer is to publish a new book
OL,8,Ftelling the life story of his sister,
OL,9,FDiana, Princess of Wales, from his
OL,10,Fperspective.
OL,12,FSwan Song: Diana, My Sister is due to
OL,13,Fbe released in the UK next month,
OL,14,Fnearly 30 years after she died.
OL,16,F"I want to speak on Diana's behalf and
OL,17,Fdo so in an openly positive way," Earl
OL,18,FSpencer said of his reasons for writing
OL,19,Fthe book.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
