OL,3,GNEWSAEarl Spencer to 'tell the truth'
OL,4,Aabout his sister Princess Diana in new
OL,5,Abook
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe added that he hoped it would enable
OL,8,Fpeople to understand who she really
OL,9,Fwas: "A one-off, dynamic character,
OL,10,Ffull of love, charisma and self-doubt,
OL,11,Fwho gave life a hell of a go, and left
OL,12,Fthe world a far better place, despite
OL,13,Fexiting the stage while still so
OL,14,Fyoung."
